# Components that hold data. The pipeline never deletes these from an org, even when their
# files are deleted in git: they are left out of destructiveChanges.xml and stay in the org.
# Remove them by hand in Setup once the data is backed up or no longer needed.
# Record types are always kept by sfdx-git-delta itself (the Metadata API cannot delete them).

# Custom objects, including custom settings, custom metadata types and platform events
**/objects/*/*.object-meta.xml

# Custom fields
**/objects/*/fields/*.field-meta.xml

# Custom metadata records
**/customMetadata/*.md-meta.xml
